    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "ava",
        "speaker": "Ava",
        "sourceStart": 5,
        "sourceEnd": 123,
        "text": "We have arranged an evening exhibit for the community gallery. The tour begins at seven on Wednesday, not on Saturday.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "5989ecbd0be0ca9318db937b47a77c39bace1c0f75b3a88a13e58257524c4251",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "luis",
        "speaker": "Luis",
        "sourceStart": 130,
        "sourceEnd": 167,
        "text": "Good. What will be in the first room?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "0c3118f30bdcad971863bc1c938d96cadd70b8abee0362295453d8a673f122bb",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ava",
        "speaker": "Ava",
        "sourceStart": 173,
        "sourceEnd": 314,
        "text": "A local artist has lent a portrait of her grandfather. The image is on a large canvas, and the frame is dark blue. She finished it last year.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "aaf1f63582bee128d7384db836e7ad84436b9b9be8ba5c2dce46e51d81384336",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "luis",
        "speaker": "Luis",
        "sourceStart": 321,
        "sourceEnd": 392,
        "text": "I have seen her landscape of the harbor. Is that in the collection too?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "a6697424e1233069cf0417d8395329b34d9f9ee244aefb7f6eeef8cb71f3fcbb",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ava",
        "speaker": "Ava",
        "sourceStart": 398,
        "sourceEnd": 516,
        "text": "No. The harbor picture is still at her home. For this display, she chose the portrait because it tells a family story.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "539f558647b166bfc021ad7aa9cdf86249e3a36d9c063f3369c206da90538c45",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "luis",
        "speaker": "Luis",
        "sourceStart": 523,
        "sourceEnd": 550,
        "text": "What about the second room?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "329e972624951ef5ab15d00ce01ac745463fec8ab715c4d2c128a7cb495a4189",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ava",
        "speaker": "Ava",
        "sourceStart": 556,
        "sourceEnd": 746,
        "text": "There is a sculpture made from clay and a small ceramic bowl. The person who made them has practiced pottery for four years. The sculpture is an animal, but it is not a statue of a real pet.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "54dbb1d671478cfc6df081c494eca7b9fe551c138de309c49d8cfd0ffd358b74",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "luis",
        "speaker": "Luis",
        "sourceStart": 753,
        "sourceEnd": 877,
        "text": "I have already written a note for the bowl, but I have not written the note for the sculpture yet. I will finish it tonight.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "18efbd7b97a45bf5f732b965f6239e8cf7344ecead8c135a14a1e81efa9cd16e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ava",
        "speaker": "Ava",
        "sourceStart": 883,
        "sourceEnd": 1107,
        "text": "Thank you. We also have a colorful piece of fabric made by a textile group. The group uses an old craft in a modern style. They say each object can tell a story about culture without representing every person in a community.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "f888eec83422c4d6ae78ff6cd3fc637574e83d4049299deb2330879565d455bd",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "luis",
        "speaker": "Luis",
        "sourceStart": 1114,
        "sourceEnd": 1141,
        "text": "Will a guide lead the tour?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "47ff4992a057e5b60f07071c48d55a22e929faf4da6ca8cdbd769b786963acbf",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ava",
        "speaker": "Ava",
        "sourceStart": 1147,
        "sourceEnd": 1311,
        "text": "Yes. The guide will speak for twenty minutes and then invite questions. Visitors may create a small drawing at the table, but they do not have to show it to anyone.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "f8d1621c7b4b3d264c509604ba9e30712d097f7f211c7515f42839a11919639c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "luis",
        "speaker": "Luis",
        "sourceStart": 1318,
        "sourceEnd": 1366,
        "text": "That sounds welcoming. Is the portrait for sale?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "ecefcde6dbc68a750a2b475ea85831b5368c7f2857dffb0bb9bb21af1e3c6a2f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ava",
        "speaker": "Ava",
        "sourceStart": 1372,
        "sourceEnd": 1528,
        "text": "No. This is a free event, and the artist will take it home afterward. I hope people notice how different a familiar scene can look in another person's work.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "387c34aae028f6c3ff5f99643e6738889132effdda7f12f547d761245d77f537",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "luis",
        "speaker": "Luis",
        "sourceStart": 1535,
        "sourceEnd": 1643,
        "text": "I agree. A creative display can help neighbors talk about things they might otherwise pass without noticing.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "d51ba2cbe5110e19eeeecc6bd00ae322af7fe324110e0458e32ad98b99d5992b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
